OpenCluely Overlay 2.3 for Windows
Based on arth-agrawal/OpenCluely and the original TechyCSR/OpenCluely.
The Windows 2.3 port incorporates the text/image, provider/model, conversation,
and close-protection updates from ashokchilka99/mac-godsplan, reference commit
f2b35228b67e0b22816ce779bc41c7503f24665d.
The Apache-2.0 LICENSE is retained in this repository. The original source
remains available from the upstream repositories and this repository's Git history.

This version uses the focused text/image overlay, native Windows lifecycle and
capture controls, encrypted storage, and a per-user Windows recovery helper.
The earlier voice, interview-specific and stealth interfaces are available in
Git history for reference and are not included in the new desktop distribution.

Version 2.5 incorporates luffy-taro-106/opencluely-overlay commit 723ad56,
including its ChatGPT account integration and passive dropdown controls.
The distribution includes the official OpenAI Codex client 0.164.0,
licensed under Apache-2.0. Its upstream source is https://github.com/openai/codex.
